WEBVTT

00:04:59.556 --> 00:05:01.076
She stands before it.

00:05:01.076 --> 00:05:04.396
A thin, dark girl
in a tattered, green sari.

00:05:04.876 --> 00:05:07.836
Her hair is whipped loose from its braid,

00:05:07.836 --> 00:05:11.476
and the end of her sari
unfurls like a flag.

00:05:13.396 --> 00:05:15.876
“Stand back,” shouts the boy in alarm.

00:05:16.156 --> 00:05:18.436
“Let me figure out the control mechanism.”

00:05:20.116 --> 00:05:21.476
Bending her head,

00:05:21.476 --> 00:05:23.716
straining against the wind,

00:05:23.716 --> 00:05:26.476
the girl walks into the monster.

00:05:28.156 --> 00:05:33.796
The monster has a middle
with a quiet place.